{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52194","headline":"颂六十二首 十九 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生来死还送，日往月复旋。\n弱丧昏风动，流浪逐物迁。\n愚戆失正路，漂没入重渊。\n一坠幽闇处，万劫履锋辛（一作「鋋」）。\n六道旋寰（一作「环」）苦，三业未曾全。\n坠（一作「随」）流无人救，凄伤还自怜。\n归诚观像物，方知虚妄筌。\n苦海深河趣，思登般若船。\n（见同书卷十八《地狱部》。\n注一作者，爲《法苑珠林》卷十二《地狱部之余》之异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52194.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52194","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}